<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezra</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoleru</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu vya Ezra na Nehemia vitakulira ntambu Waisraeli pawajimilitwi kuwuya Israeli, shakapanu kutolwa wamanda aku Uajemi na Babeli. Ezra kayowelera nentu ntambu gaa yakunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu aku Yerusalemu. Wabetula wavuwa wamjimira handa Ezra ndo yakalembiti shitabu sha mirandu ya shaka sha kwanja na sha pili na shitabu sha Ezra na Nehemiya. Handa ndiri Ezra, kwana muntu yumonga yakalembiti vitabu avi. Shitabu sha Ezra iwezakaniti shilembwa mushinja sha mia msheshi arubayini pamberi pa kwiwuka Kristu, kumbiti vipandi vimonga vya shitabu vilembwitwi vyaka vimonga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Ezra shilanguziya ntambu gaa Mlungu kamtenditi mfalumi Koreshi gwa Uajemi kuwajimilira Waisraeli kuwuya ukaya kwawu na kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Mlandu agu viraa guweriti gulanguziya umbuyi wa Yeremia utendekiti mshitabu sha Yeremiya, shipandi sha 29:10-14. Kuweriti muwamu mwa wankondu yawajeriti kulewelera kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, hangu lihengu ali ligolokiti kwa shaka, Kumbiti Waisraeli waweziti kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ayi kwa kutangwa na Mlungu. Kwa ukolamlima wa Ezra viraavirii Waisraeli woyiti vidoda vyawu na kumgalambukira Mlungu. Mlandu agu guweriti mwanjiru gwa syayi gwa kulilaviya kwawu kwa kufata lagiru lya Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweraamu mushitabu sha Ezra</para>
  <para style="io">Mfalumi koreshi kawajimiriti Waisraeli kuwuya ukaya kwawu na walanga ya kaya zyaziwuyiti. Shipandi sha kwanja na sha pili.</para>
  <para style="io">Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu yayiweriti Yerusalemu ntambu yayinyawitwi kayi. Shipandi sha tatu mpaka sha sita.</para>
  <para style="io">Ezra ntambu yakawuyiti Yerusalemu pakawera na kaya zimonga na Waisraeli. Shipandi sha saba na sha nani.</para>
  <para style="io">Ezra ntambu yakawalonguziyiti Waisraeli kutenda kayi lipatanu na Mlungu. Shipandi sha tisa mpaka kumi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s">Koleshi kankuwatanga Waisraeli kuwuya kwawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Mushinja sha kwanja sha ukolamlima wa Koreshi, mfalumi gwa Uajemi, Su shisoweru sha Mtuwa Mlungu shakatakuliti kwa kupitira mbuyi Yeremiya shitimiyi. Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi Koreshi mfalumi gwa Uajemi, kalaviyi lagiru ayi muufalumi wakuyi na lagiru ali lilaviyitwi kwa kulembwa.<verse eid="EZR 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />Hangu ndo ntambu yakalonga Koreshi, mfalumi gwa Uajemi. Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa kumpindi, kampanana falumi zoseri za pasipanu na kandagalira nimunyawiri Numba Nkulu aku Yerusalemu, muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Hangu, kila muntu muwamu mwenu woseri mwenga yamuwera wantu wakuyi,Mtuwa Mlungu gwakuyi kaweri pamuhera nayu na kagendi Yerusalemu aku Yuda na kuyinyawa kayi numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, Mlungu yakaguwirwa aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Kila yumu yakasigaliti mkomu muumanda pakafira kuwuya, wantu wapakwegera na yomberi wamtangi kwa kumpanana madini ga feza, zahabu, pamuhera na vintu na vigongolu, pamuhera na malaviwu ga kufira weni toziya ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Hangu, wawuka walongoziya wa nkolu za makabila ga Yuda na Benjamini na watambika na Walawi na kila muntu mweni Mlungu kampanana moyu gwa kugenda kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, yayiwera aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Wapakwegera na womberi wawatangiti walonguziya awa kwa kuwapanana vyombu vya madini ga feza, zahabu na lunda, vigongolu na vintu vimonga vya beyi nkulu, na virii yavilaviwitwi kwa kufira weni toziya ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="EZR 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Mfalumi Koreshi kawawuziliriti vyombu vyeni mfalumi Nebukadineza kaweriti kavitola munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu na kuvitula mnumba ya wamlungu wakuyi. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Kampananiti Mitiredati, yakaweriti mtula vyombu avi na yomberi kaviwalanga kulongolu kwa Sheshibaza, mkolamlima gwa Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />Avi ndo vintu vyaviwalangitwi: Bakuli selasini za zahabu, Bakuli elufu yimu za madini ga feza, visahani vidikadika ishilini na tisa vya madini ga feza, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />Bakuli ndidini za zahabu selasini, Bakuli ndidini za madini ga feza miya msheshi na lilongu, Vyombu vimonga elufu yimu.<verse eid="EZR 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Vyombu vyoseri vya zahabu na feza, pamuhera na vintu vimonga viweriti elufu mhanu miya msheshi. Vyoseri avi, Sheshibaza kavitoliti mpaka Yerusalemu shaka yomberi pamuhera na wantu wamonga pawalawiti muuhamisiwu Babeli kugenda Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s">Walanga ya wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NEH 7:4-73">Nehemiya 7:4-73</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Awa ndo wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu weni Nebukadineza mfalumi gwa Babeli kawapelekiti malopola Babeli, wawuya kumji Yerusalemu na muisi ya Yuda. Kila muntu kawuyiti kumji gwakuyi. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Awa ndo wakulu yawawuyiti nawa awa. Zerubabeli na Yeshuwa na Nehemiya na Seraya na Reelaya, Moridekai na Bilishani na Misipari na Bigwai na Rehumu na Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Awa ndo wantu wa nkolu za Israeli yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu: <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Paroshi yawawuyiti waweriti elufu mbili miya yimu sabini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Shefatiya waweriti miya tatu sabini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Ara waweriti miya saba sabini na mhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Pahati Mowabu, walii wiwuka wa Yeshuwa na Yoabu waweriti elufu mbili miya nani kumi na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Eramu waweriti elufu yimu miya mbili amusini na msheshi. <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Zatu waweriti miya tisa alubayini na mhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Zakayi waweriti miya saba sitini. <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Bani waweriti miya sita alubayini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Bebayi waweriti miya sita ishilini na tatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Azigadi waweriti elufu yimu miya mbili ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Adonikamu waweriti miya sita sitini na sita, <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />wantu wa lukolu lwa Bigwai waweriti elufu mbili na amusini na sita. <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Adini waweriti miya msheshi amusini na msheshi. <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Ateri viraa liawu limonga Hezekiya waweriti tisini na nani. <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Besayi waweriti miya tatu ishilini na tatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Yora waweriti miya yimu kumi na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Hashumu waweriti miya mbili ishilini na tatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />Wantu wa lukolu lwa Gibari waweriti tisini na mhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Wantu wa mji gwa Betilehemu waweriti miya yimu ishilini na tatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />Wantu wa mji gwa Netofa waweriti amusini na sita. <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />Wantu wa mji gwa Anatoti waweriti miya yimu ishilini na nani. <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />Wantu wa mji gwa Azimaweti waweriti alubayini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />Wantu wa mji gwa Kiriyati Yearimu na Kefira na Beeroti waweriti miya saba alubayini na tatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />Wantu wa mji gwa Rama na Geba waweriti miya sita ishilini na yimu. <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />Wantu wa mji gwa Mikimashi waweriti miya yimu ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />Wantu wa mji gwa Beteli na Ai waweriti miya mbili ishilini na tatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />Wantu wa mji gwa Nebo waweriti amusini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />Wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa wa mji gwa Magibishi waweriti miya yimu amusini na sita. <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />Wantu wa mji gwa Eramu gwa pili waweriti elufu yimu miya mbili amusini na msheshi. <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />Wantu wa mji gwa Harimu waweriti miya tatu ishilini. <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />Wantu wa mji gwa Lodi na Hadidi na Ono waweriti miya saba ishilini na mhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />Wantu wa mji gwa Yeriku waweriti miya tatu alubayini na mhanu. <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />Wantu wa mji gwa Senaa waweriti elufu tatu miya sita selasini.<verse eid="EZR 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Awa ndo watambika yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu: Watambika wa lukolu lwa Yedaya, yawaweriti wa wiwuka wa Yeshuwa waweriti miya sita sabini na tatu. <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />Watambika wa lukolu lwa Imeri waweriti elufu yimu na amusini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />Watambika wa lukolu lwa Pashuri waweriti elufu yimu miya mbili alubayini na saba. <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />Watambika wa lukolu lwa Harimu waweriti elufu yimu kumi na saba. <verse eid="EZR 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Walawi yawawuyiti muuhamisiwa waweriti: Wantu wa lukolu lwa Yeshuwa na lwa Kadimieli, wiwuka wa Hodaviya waweriti sabini na msheshi. <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Wantu awa waweriti wimba: Kulawa wiwuka wa Asafu waweriti miya yimu ishilini na nani. <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Awa ndo wantu yawaweriti walolera: Kulawa wiwuka wa Shalumu na wa Ateri na wa Talimoni na wa Akubu na wa Hatita na wa Shoba, waweriti miya yimu selasini na tisa. <verse eid="EZR 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Nkolu za wantu zyaziweriti zyankutenda lihengu munumba nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu na wawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa ndo azi: Lukolu lwa Siha na lukolu lwa Hasufa na lukolu lwa Tabaoti, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />Lukolu lwa Kerosi na lukolu lwa Siaha na lukolu lwa Padoni, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />Lukolu lwa Lebana na lukolu lwa Hagaba na lukolu lwa Akubu, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />Lukolu lwa Hagabu na lukolu lwa Shamlai na lukolu lwa Hanani, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />Lukolu lwa Gideli na lukolu lwa Gahari na lukolu lwa Reaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />Lukolu lwa Resini na lukolu lwa Nekoda na lukolu lwa Gazamu, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />Lukolu lwa Uza na lukolu lwa Pasea na lukolu lwa Besai, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />Lukolu lwa Asina na lukolu lwa Meunimu na lukolu lwa Nefisimu, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />Lukolu lwa Bakibuki na lukolu lwa Hakufa na lukolu lwa Harihuri, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />Lukolu lwa Basiluti na lukolu wa Mehida na lukolu lwa Harisha, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />Lukolu lwa Barikosi na lukolu lwa Sisera na lukolu lwa Tema, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />Lukolu lwa Nezia na lukolu lwa Hatifa. <verse eid="EZR 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Ayi ndo walanga za wiwuka wa wantumintumi wa mfalumi Selemani yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa: Luweriti lukolu lwa Sotai na lukolu lwa Hasofereti na lukolu lwa Peruda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />Lukolu lwa Yaala na lukolu lwa Darikoni na lukolu lwa Gideli, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />Lukolu lwa Shefatiya na lukolu lwa Hatili na lukolu lwa Pokereti Hasebaimu na lukolu lwa Ami. <verse eid="EZR 2:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Na wiwuka wa wantumintumi woseri wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu na wiwuka wa wantumintumi wa Selemani yawawuyiti kulawa muumanda waweriti wantu miya tatu tisini na mbili.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Wantu wa miji ayi, viraa wawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu: Wantu wa mji gwa Teli Mela na Teli Harisha na Kerubu na Adani na Imeri, kumbiti womberi wasinditi kulanguziya handa nkolu zawu zilawirana na Waisraeli. <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Womberi waweriti wa lukolu lwa Delaya na Tobia na Nekoda, weni waweriti wantu miya sita amsini na mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Wantu wa nkolu azi za watambika viraa wawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa: Lukolu lwa Habaya na lukolu lwa Hakosi na lukolu lwa Barizilayi. Ayu Barizilayi kaweriti kayuga mhinga gwa Gileadi na yomberi viraa kashemitwi Barizilayi. <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Awa wasakuliti matawu gawu mumaholu ga nkolu, kumbiti wawoneka ndiri amu. Hangu wajimiliwiti ndiri kuwera watambika toziya wajimiritwindiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Mkolamlima kawagambira kuwera wajimiruwa ndiri kuliya shiboga shishilaviwitwi kwa Mlungu, mpaka paweri na mtambika yakaweza kwamuwa kwa libuwi lya Urimu na Tumimu. <verse eid="EZR 2:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Wantu woseri yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu waweriti elufu alubayini mbili miya tatu sitini, <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />Viraa virii, kuweriti na wantumintumi wapalu na wadala elufu saba miya tatu selasini na saba na yawimba wapalu kwa wadala, waweriti miya mbili. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Kuweriti na farasi miyasaba selasini na sita, nyumbu farasi miya mbili alubayini na mhanu, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />Ngamiya miya msheshi selasini na mhanu na punda elufu sita miya saba ishilini.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Wantu awa yawalawiti muuhamisiwu, pawasokiti kunumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu kumji gwa Yerusalemu, wamu wa wakulu wa nkolu azi walaviyiti malaviwu ga kufira weni su kumtanga unyawa wa numba ya Mlungu mu Yerusalemu palii payiweriti kwanja. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Kila muntu kalaviyiti ntambu yakafira mweni. Walanga ya malaviwu aga iweriti kilu miya mhanu za zahabu, kilu elufu mbili miya nani za feza na nguwu miya yimu kwa watambika.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Su, watambika na Walawi na wamu wa wantu wamonga wanja kulikala kumji Yerusalemu na muvijiji vyakuyi. Na wayimba na walolera wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu na wantumintumi wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu wanja kulikala kumiji yawu na Waisraeli woseri walikaliti mumiji yawu.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuguwira kwakwanja kayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Pagusokiti mwezi gwa saba wantu wa Israeli yawaweriti walikala kala mumiji yawu, woseri wajojonikiti pamuhera aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Yosadaki, pamuhera na watambika wayaguyi na Zerubaberi, mwana gwa Shealitieli, pamuhera na walongu wakuyi, wanyawiti kayi shitalawanda sha mabuhi sha Mlungu gwa Israeli, su wawezi kumlavilira tambiku za kulunguziya ntambu yayilembitwi mulilagiru lya Musa, muntu gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Wanyawiti shitalawanda ashi pahala palapalii pashiweriti makashu, toziya wawatiriti wantu yawaweriti wankulikala muisi ayi. Shakapanu waweriti wankumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku za kulunguziwa pampindi pakuyi kila mandawira na pamihi. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Watenditi msambu gwa visasa ntambu yayilembitwi mulilagiru, kila lishaka walaviyiti tambiku za kulunguziwa zyazifiruwitwi mulishaka ali. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Viraa walaviyiti tambiku za ntambu iraayi za kulunguziya nakamu za kila lishaka na tambiku yazilaviwitwi shaka sha msambu gwa mwezi gwa syayi na mumisambu imonga yoseri yakalagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu. Viraa, walaviyiti tambiku zoseri kwa kufira weni. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Tembera lyanjiru lya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu liweriti lyankali kunyawa, wantu wanjiti kulaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwanjira lishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa saba.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Numba nkulu ya Mlungu yakwanja kunyawa kayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Shakapanu wantu walaviyiti mpiya za kuwalipa wasongola mabuhi na wasongola mbawu na wanyawa, viravilii walaviyiti shiboga, virandu na lipaki lya mizeyituni, su vijegitwi mumiji ya Tiru na Sidoni kupata mitera ya miyerezi kulawa Lebanoni. Mitera ayi ijegitwi kupitira mubahari mpaka Yopa. Goseri aga gatendekiti kwa utanga wa mfalumi Koreshi gwa Uajemi. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Su, wantu wanjiti lihengu mumwezi gwa pili gwa shinja sha pili pa kusoka mnumba ya Mlungu kumji gwa Yerusalemu. Zerubaberi, mwana gwa Shelitiyeli, Yoshuwa mwana gwa Yosadaki na walongu wawu wamonga na watambika na Walawi na wantu wamonga woseri yawawuyiti Yerusalemu kulawa muuhamisiwu, waweriti pamuhera mulihengu ali. Walawi woseri yawaweriti wa vinja ishilini ama nentu, wasyagulitwi su kugolokera lihengu lya kuyinyawa kayi numba ya Mlungu. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Yoshuwa na wana wakuyi na walongu wakuyi pamuhera na Kadimiyeli na wana wakuyi wa lukolu lwa Yuda waweriti pamuhera kugolokera unyawa wa numba ya Mlungu. Viravilii watangitwi na wiwuka wa Henadadi na walongu wawu Walawi.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Wanyawa pawanjiti kunyawa lyanjiru lya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, watambika agawu pawawera wavala nguwu zawu, wagolokiti pahala panu na mapenka mumawoku mwawu na Walawi wa lukolu lwa Asafu wagolokiti na magombugombu gawu. Hangu wamkwisiti Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yawalagaliritwi na mfalumi Dawudi gwa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Wimbiti kwa kwankana, pawamzyuma na kumkwisa Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EZR 3:11">“Toziya ufiru na uheri wakuyi kwa Israeli ulikala mashaka goseri.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">Wantu woseri wamkwisiti Mtuwa Mlungu kwa makakala gawu goseri, toziya liyanjiru lya Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu gwanjitwi kunyawa. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Kumbiti watambika wavuwa na Walawi na wakulu wa nkolu yawaweriti wazewi na weni waweriti wawona Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu ya kwanja, waliriti kwa liziwu likulu pawaliwoniti lyanjiru lya numba ya Mlungu lyankunyawa, agawu wantu wamonga wabotiti kwa kunemelera. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Wantu wawezitindiri kulinganiziya pakati pa maziwu ga nemeru na ga kulira, toziya wantu watenditi umatu nentu na umatu wawu upikanikiti kutali nentu.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulewelerwa kwa kunyawa kayi kwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Shakapanu wankondu wa wantu wa Yuda na Benjamini pawapikiniriti handa wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu wankunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />Zerubabeli na wakulu wa nkolu wamgendiriti na kumgambira, “Shondi gututangi kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu. Twenga handa mwenga tumguwira Mlungu gwenu na tuwera twankumlavilira tambiku kwanjira makashu ga Esari Hadoni, mfalumi gwa Ashuru yakatujegiti panu.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Kumbiti Zerubabeli na Yoshuwa na wakulu wamonga wa nkolu za Israeli wamgambira, “Twenga tufirandiri mwenga mtutangi kunyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu gwetu. Twaweni twenga hatumnyawiri Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, handa mfalumi Koreshi gwa Uajemi ntambu yakatugambiziyiti.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Shakapanu, wantu yawaweriti wankulikala pahala panu wafiriti kuwatweziya na wawatenditi Wayuda watiri. Su nawendereya kunyawa. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Viraavirii wawapananiti swinda wakulu wa isi ya Uajemi wawadiwili shawafira kutenda Wayuda. Wendereyiti kutenda hangu shaka shoseri sha ukolamlima wa Koreshi, mpaka shaka sha ukolamlima wa Dario.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyawa kayi kwa Yerusalemu kulemwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Mfalumi Ahasuero pakanjiti kukolamlima, wankondu wa wantu yawalikaliti Yuda na Yerusalemu wawalemberiti hamba za kusitaka kwa mfalumi.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Shakapanu pakakolitimlima Aritashasta, mfalumi gwa Uajemi, Bishilamu na Mitiredati na Tabeeli na waganja wakuyi, wamlemberiti luhamba mfalumi Aritashasta. Luhamba alu lulembitwi kwa malembu ga Kiaramu na kutafisiliwa kwa luga mfalumi kayimana.<verse eid="EZR 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Viraavirii mkolamlima Rehumu na Shimshai mlemba, kamlemberiti Aritashasta luhamba alu toziya ya wantu wa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />“Baruwa ayi ilawa kwa neni Rehumu, mkolamlima na Shimshai mlemba, pamuhera na wayetu na watoza na wakulu na woseri yawalawa mumji gwa Ereki na Babeli na Susa muisi ya Eramu, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />pamuhera na wantu wa maisi gamonga yawatolitwi na Asuri Banipali, muntu mkulu na yakana makakala na kuwahamisiya na kuwajegera kumji gwa Samariya na pahala pamonga wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa Eufrati.”<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Luhamba lweni lulongiti hangu.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="EZR 4:11">“Kwa mfalumi Aritashasta, twenga wantumintumi waku kulawa muisi ya kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa Eufrati, tukulamsiya.<verse eid="EZR 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />Gwee mfalumi tufira guvimani, handa Wayahudi wiziti panu kulawa pahala pamonga pa ufalumi waku wagenda Yerusalemu na wankunyawa kayi mji gwana wantu wagalambuka na wakontola. Wankumalilira kunyawa vibambaza vyakuyi na kunyawa miyanjiru. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Gwee mfalumi, tufira guvimani handa mji agu pagunyawiwa kayi na vibambaza vyakuyi pavipera, wantu hapeni walipi kodi, ushulu pota ada na luhanja lwaku halupunguwi. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Toziya twenga tukujimira gwenga mfalumi, tufirandiri kukuwona gwenga mfalumi gwetu gusoniziwi, hangu tuwona iherepa tukugambiri. <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />Su ulolalola utendeki mumaholu ga wambuyi waku, amu haguyambuli handa kwanjira makashu, wantu wa mji agu waweriti wagalambuka na kuwagaziya nentu wafalumi na wakolamlima wa isi. Mirandu ayi igutenditi mji agu guhalibisiwi. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Hangu tukugambira handa payiwera mji agu hagunyawiwi kayi na vibambaza vyakuyi pavipera, hapeni guwezi kukolamlima isi ya kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba lwa Eufrati.”<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Shakapanu mfalumi kawankuliti hangu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 4:17">“Kwa mkolamlima Rehumu na kwa Shishai mlemba, pamuhera na wayenu woseri yawalikala Samaliya na yawalikala pahala pamonga muisi ya kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba lwa Eufrati.<verse eid="EZR 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />Luhamba lwamnjegeriti lubetulwa kulongolu kwangu na neni nilumana. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Ndagaliriti ulolalola utendeki na imanikana kuwera kwanjira makashu mji agu gwa Yerusalemu guweriti guwalera wafalumi na gumema wantu wagalambuka na wakontola. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Wafalumi wana makakala wagukolitimlima mji agu na isi ya kwaguzyetera mshenji mulushemba Eufrati agawu pawawera wankutola kodi na ushuru. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Hangu, muwalagaliri wantu awa waleki kugunyawa kayi mji agu mpaka pandagalira kayi. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Mtendi mlandu agu kalongola, naniza kupata asala.”<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Pawamaliriti kubetula luhamba alu kulawa kwa Aritashasita, Rehumu na Shimshai yakaweriti mlemba na wayaguyi walopokera kugenda Yerusalemu na kuwakakanika Wayahudi waleki kugunyawa mji.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wakwanja kayi kutenda lihengu ku Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Hangu lihengu lya kunyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu kumji gwa Yerusalemu ligolokiti mpaka shinja sha pili sha ukolamlima wa Dario, mfalumi gwa Uajemi.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Mashaka aga, wambuyi wawili, Hagayi na Zekariya, mwana gwa Ido, wawalaviliriti umbuyi Wayahudi yawaweriti walikala mji mkulu gwa Yuda na Yerusalemu, kwa litawu lya Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Shakapanu Zerubabeli, mwana gwa Shealitieli na Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Yosadaki, pawapikiniriti ulagilagi awu wanjiti kayi kuyinyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu mumji gwa Yerusalemu, pawatangwa na wambuyi wa Mlungu.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Shaka shiraashi Tatinayi, mkolamlima gwa mji gwa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Eufrati na Shetari Bozenayi na wayaguyi, wagenditi Yerusalemu na kukosiya, “Gaa yakawagambiziyiti kuyinyawa kayi numba ayi mpaka muyimalira?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Viraa wakosiyiti, Ndo ashina gaa yawanyawa nyumba ayi? Tugafira matawu gawu. <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Kumbiti Mlungu kaweriti kankuwalolera wakulu wa Shiyahudi, hangu wakulu awa wawaberandiri mpaka pawamlembiriti mfalumi Dariu na kupikanira shakalongiti. <verse eid="EZR 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Su, Tatenai, mkolamlima gwa mji gwa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Eufrati na Shetari Bozenai na wayaguyi, wamlemberiti luhamba mfalumi Dariu.<verse eid="EZR 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Luhamba alu luweriti lulonga hangu. Kwa mfalumi Dariu, tukufilira ponga.<verse eid="EZR 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />Tufira kukugambira gwee mfalumi, kuwera tugenditi kumji gwa Yuda payiweriti Numba Nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu mkulu, wantu wankuyinyawa numba kwa mabuwi makulumakulu na shibambaza shakuyi pashisoka pampindi shimatikwa mbawu. Lihengu ali litendwa kwa makakala na lyendereya weri.<verse eid="EZR 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />Tuwakosiyiti wakulu wawu, ndo gaa kawapananiti lagira ya kunyawa kayi numba ayi mpaka kuyimalira. <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Viraavirii tuwakosiyiti matawu ga walii wakulu su tukugambiri gwenga mfalumi walii yawagolokera lihengu ali.<verse eid="EZR 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />Womberi watwankuliti hangu, twenga ndo wantumintumi wa Mlungu gwa kumpindi na pasipanu na twankuyinyawa kayi numba ayi yayinyawitwi na kumalirika vinja vitangala na mfalumi mkulu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Kumbiti toziya wambuyi wetu wamkalaziyiti Mlungu gwa kumpindi, yomberi kawaleka wakankwi na mfalumi Nebukadineza gwa Babeli, muntu kulawa isi ya Kalidayu, yomberi ndo yakayibomoliti numba ayi na kuwajega wantu muumanda aku Babeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Kumbiti mushinja sha kwanja sha ukolamlima wakuyi mfalumi Koreshi gwa Babeli kalagaliriti numba nkulu ayi ya Mtuwa Mlungu inyawiwi kayi. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Viraavirii kaviwuziya vyombu vya zahabu na feza vyeni mfalumi Nebukadineza kaweriti kavitoliti munumba nkulu ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu na kuvitula munumba ya wamlungu wakuyi aku Babeli. Vyombu avi Koreshi kaviwusiyiti kunumba ya wamlungu wakuyi na kumpanana Sheshibaza mweni kamsyagulitwi kaweri mfalumi gwa Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Kamlagalira, Gutoli vyombu avi na kuviwuziya Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu yayiwera Yerusalemu na kuyinyawa kayi Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Shakapanu Sheshibaza kiziti na kutula lwanjiru lya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu mumji gwa Yerusalemu na kulawa mashaka aga wantu wenderiyiti kunyawa kumbiti numba imalirika ndiri.’<verse eid="EZR 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />Vinu pagufira gwee mfalumi, guwalagaliri wantu waloliloli mumaholu ga shifalumi mumji gwa Babeli handa mfalumi Koreshi kalagaliriti numba ayi ya Mlungu inyawiwi kayi mumji gwa Yerusalemu. Shakapanu tukuluwa gutugambiziyi shagulonga kwa mlandu agu.<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s">Lagila lya Mfalumi Dariu iwoneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Mfalumi Dariu kalagaliriti, wantu waloliloli mumaholu yagawera munumba ya shifalumi aku Babeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Kumbiti shitabu shiwonikiti mji gwa Ekibatana mumji gwa Mediya na sheni shiweriti na malagalalira aga:<verse eid="EZR 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />Mfalumi Koreshi pakakolitimlima mushinja sha kwanja kalagaliriti Numba ya Mlungu inyawiwi kayi kumji gwa Yerusalemu, panu paweri pahala pa kulaviwa tambiku na malaviwu ga kulunguziwa. Kugenda kumpindi kuweritin mita ishilini na saba upana wakuyi mita ishilini na saba. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Vibambaza vyakuyi vinyawiwi kwa msitali mitatu ya mabuhi makulu na pampindi pakuyi patulwi mbawu. Malipu gakuyi galawi munumba ya mfalumi. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Viravirii, Vyombu vyoseri vya zahabu na feza vyakavitoliti mfalumi Nebukadineza kulawa kunumumba nkulu ya Mlungu aku Yerusalemu na kuvijegera Babeli, vifiruwa viwuziwi na kila shintu shilikali pahala pakuyi munumba nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi Dariu kawagambiziya lihengu lya kunyawa lyendeleyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Ndo mfalumi Dariu kajega ulagilagi awu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 6:6">Kwa Tatenai, mkolamlima gwa mji gwa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba lwa Eufrati na Shetari Bozenai na wakulu wayagu.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="EZR 6:6">Mlikali kutali na Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />mleki lihengu lya unyawa wa Numba Nkulu ayi ya Mlungu lyendereyi. Mumuleki mkolamlima gwa isi ya Yuda na wakulu wa Wayahudi wayinyawa Numba ya Mlungu pahala pakuyi. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Nentu ya aga, ndagalira handa mwenga hamuwatangi mulihengu ali. Malipu gawu goseri gankulawa mumji gwa kwaguzyetera mshenji mulushemba Eufrati, su lihengu naligoloka. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Kila lishaka pota kuleka, hamuwapanani watambika wa Yerusalemu kila shintu shawafira, iweri ng'ombi shipalu mdidini, kondolu shipalu ama mwana kondolu gwa tambiku za kulunguziya kwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi, ama nganu ama munu ama divayi ama lipaki lya mizeyituni. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Goseri aga hagatendeki su wawezi kumlavilira Mlungu gwa kumpindi tambiku yazimfiriziya na wanduwiri neni na wana wangu. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Viraavirii ndagalira muntu yoseri yakajimira ndiri lagiru ali, mpandakati itupulwi munumba yakuyi isongolwi uwega wumu na katumbulirwi. Shakapanu numba yakuyi itendeki kuwera lifunkusi. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Mlungu yakasyaguliti mji gwa Yerusalemu kuwera pahala pakuyi su wantu wamguwiri yomberi na kamgusiyi mfalumi ama muntu yoseri yakalema kukola lagiru ali ama yakafira kuyihalibisiya numba ayi ya Mlungu yayiweriti kumji Yerusalemu. Neni Dariu ndagalira kila muntu kajimiri lagiru ali.<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Numba nkulu ya Mlungu yankulaviwa kwajili ya Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Kwa lagiru lyakalagaliriti mfalumi Dariu na Tatenayi, mkolamlima gwa mkowa gwa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Eufrati na Shetari Bozenayi na wakulu wayawu, wajimiriti malagaliru ga mfalumi kwa makakala gawu goseri. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Wakulu wa Wayahudi wendereyiti weri nentu na lihengu lya unyawa wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu, pawapananwa moyu na mbuyi Hagai na Zekaria, mwana gwa Ido. Wamaliliti kunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu ntambu yawagambilitwi na Mlungu gwa Israeli na ntambu yawalagaliritwi na mfalumi Koreshi na mfalumi Dariu na mfalumi Aritashasita, gwa Uajemi. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Lihengu lya kunyawa numba ayi liperiti mlishaka lya tatu lya mwezi gwagushemwa Adari, mushinja sha sita sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Dariu. <verse eid="EZR 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Su, wantu wa Israeli na watambika na Walawi na wantu wamonga yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu, wayipungiti numba nkulu ayi ya Mtuwa Mlungu kwa nemeru nkulu. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Pawayipungiti numba nkulu ya Mlungu, walaviyiti ng'ombi shipalu miya yimu, kondolu shipalu miya mbili, wanakondolu miya msheshi na mbuzi shipalu kumi na mbili toziya ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, mbuzi yumu kwa kila likabila lya israeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Viravirii, wawapanga, watambika na Walawi mulihengu lya Mlungu ntambu yayilagaliritwi mushitabu sha Musa.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Mlishaka limu lya kumi na msheshi lya mwezi gwa kwanja, wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa wanemeleliti msambu gwa Pasaka. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Watambika na Walawi waweriti wankulipunga, woseri waweriti waherepa nentu. Walikituliti mwanakondolu gwa Pasaka toziya ya wantu woseri yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa na toziya ya walongu wawu watambika na toziya yaweni. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Yawaliyiti mwanakondolu gwa Pasaka waweriti Waisraeli woseri yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu pamuhera na wantu wamonga woseri yawaweriti waleka njira za wantu yawawerandiri Wayahudi su wamguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Kwa mashaka saba wantu wanemeleliti kwa sheleku msambu gwa mabumunda yagalekeruwa ndiri simika, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawapanananiti nemeru na kamtenda mfalumi gwa Ashuru kawafiri womberi na kawatangiti kunyawa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s">Ezra kankusoka Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Pa vinja vitangala vya ukolamlima wa mfalumi Aritashasta gwa Uajemi, paweriti na muntu yumu wamshemiti Ezra. Ezra kaweriti mwana gwa Seraya na Seraya kaweriti mwana gwa Azaria na Azaria kaweriti mwana gwa Hilikiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilikiya kaweriti mwana gwa Amariya na Amariya kaweriti mwana gwa Azariya na Azariya kaweriti mwana gwa Merayoti, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />Merayoti kaweriti mwana gwa Zerariya na Zarariya kaweriti mwana wa Azariya na Azariya kaweriti mwana gwa Merayoti, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />Merayoti kaweriti mwana gwa Zerahiya na Zerahiya kaweriti mwana gwa Uzi na Uzi kaweriti mwana gwa Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buki kaweriti mwana gwa Abishuwa na Abishuwa kaweriti mwana gwa Finehasi na Finehasi kaweriti mwana gwa Eleazari na Eleazari kaweriti mwana gwa Aruni mtambika mkulu.<verse eid="EZR 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Ezra kawukiti Babeli, yomberi kaweriti mfunda yakana umani uvuwa nentu mulilagilu lyeni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, zyakaweriti kampanana Musa. Mfalumi kampananiti Ezra kila shintu shakafiriti toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Mshinja sha saba shakakolitimlima mfalumi Aritashasta, Ezira kalawiti Babeli kagenda Yerusalemu. Kalilongoziyiti pamuhera na wamu wa wantu wa Israeli na watambika na Walawi na Wayimba na walolera migomi mikulu na watendera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Wasokiti mji gwa Yerusalemu mulishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa mhanu mushinja sha saba sha ukolamulima wa mfalumi Aritashasta. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kagufaniziya nentu mwanja gwawu yawanjiti mulishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa kwanja. Kamtangiti. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Ezra kaweriti kalilaviya kwa moyu goseri kulifunda galiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kuyijimira na kuwafunda wantu wa Israeli malagalalira na lagiru zakuyi.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhamba lwakapananitwi Ezra kulawa kwa mfalumi Aritashasita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Alu ndo luhamba lweni Aritashasita kampananiti Ezra, yakaweriti mtambika na mfunda na yakana umana nentu lagiru na maberiziwu geni Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="EZR 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />Kulawa kwa Aritashasita, mfalumi gwa wafalumi, nikujegera luhamba alu gwenga Ezra, mtambika na mmana gwa lagiru lya Mtuwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi, Gwakashina!<verse eid="EZR 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />Ndagalira handa muukolamlima wa neni, muntu yoseri gwa Israeli, ama watambika wawu ama Mlawi, pakafira kuwuya Yerusalemu, kaweza kugenda pamuhera na gwenga. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Neni pamuhera na wagambiziya wa neni saba, tukulagalira gugendi Yuda na Yerusalemu gukatendi ulolalola wa lagiru lya Mlungu gwaku yagupananitwi gwenga handa ikolwa nakaka. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Hagutoli vipandi vya madini ga feza na zahabu geni neni na wagambiziya wa neni tumlavilira kwa kufira weni Mlungu gwa Israeli mweni Numba Nkulu yakuyi ya Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />Hagutoli viraa vipandi vya madini ga feza na zahabu yoseri yagujojonira muisi yoseri ya Babeli, pamuhera na mafupu ga kufira weni gawalaviyiti Waisraeli na watambika wawu toziya ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu gwawu yayiwera Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZR 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />Mpiya azi haguyitenderi kwa kulola weri kuhemera wang'ombi shipalu, wakondolu shipalu, wanakondolu na tambika ya viboga na divayi na kuvilaviya mushitalawanda munumba nkulu ya Mlungu gwenu yayiwera aku Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Mpiya na zahabu yayisigala guweza kuyitendera pamuhera na wanalushi wayagu ntambu yamufira, handa Mlungu ntambu yakafira. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Vintu vyoseri vyawakupananiti toziya ya nguwira ya Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku, hagumlavaliri Mlungu gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Pagufira shintu shimonga shoseri toziya ya Numba ya Mlungu gwaku, guweza kushipata kulawa muluhanja lwa mfalumi.<verse eid="EZR 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />Neni mfalumi Aritashasita, ndagalira kwa watula luhanja woseri mumji gwa kwaguzyeta mshenji ya lushemba Eufrati, handa shoseri shakafira Ezra, mtambiku na mfunda gwa lagiru ya Mlungu gwa kumpindi, gumpanani ntambu yakafira. <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />Upeleru wa kumpanana ndo kilu elufu tatu miya msheshi za vipandi vya madini ga feza, nganu kilu lilongu elufu, divayi lita elufu mbili na lipaki lya mizaituni lita elufu mbili na munu shiyasi shoseri shakafira. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Kila shintu shakalagaliriti Mlungu gwa kumpindi toziya ya numba yakuyi, mpaka shitendeki teratera, nakiza kuukalalira ufalumi wa neni ama wa wanawangu. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Viraavirii tuwagambirani mbereziwa kutola kodi na ada kwa watambika na Walawi na wayimba na walolera ligomi likulu na watenda lihengu ama wantumintumi wa Numba Nkulu ayi ya Mlungu.<verse eid="EZR 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />Na gwenga Ezra, kwa luhala lwakakupananiti Mlungu gwaku, ayi yaguwera nayi, gusyaguli mahakimu na watoza yawafira kuwalonguziya wantu woseri wa mji gwa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa lushemba Eufrati weni walikala kwa kukola lagira lya Mlungu gwaku. Na muntu yakayimana ndiri lagiru ayi kafiruwa gumfundi. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Muntu yoseri hakajimili ndiri lagiru ya Mlungu gwaku ama ya mfalumi, na katozwi kufuwa ama kahamisiwi ama kapokwi lunda yakuyi ama kutatirwa.<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra kankumzyuma Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Ezra kalonga, kazyumwi Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa watati wetu, weni kampanana mfalumi moyu gwa kuyipanana ligoya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu yayiwera Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Kwa lusungu lwakuyi Mlungu, ntangitwi na mfalumi na wakulu yawana uwezu mkulu. Nilipananiti moyu kwa kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwangu, kaweriti pamuhera naneni, mpaka paniwajojoniliti wakulu wa Israeli su wawuyi pamuhera na neni.<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s">Wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Awa ndo wakulu wa nkolu za wantu yawawuyiti pamuhera na neni Ezra kulawa Babeli, shaka sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Aritashasita: <verse eid="EZR 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Finehasi, kaweriti Gerishomu, na mlonguziya gwa Itamari kaweriti Danieli, mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Dawudi kaweriti Hatushi, <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Paroshi, kaweriti Zekaria mwana gwa Shekania, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu miya yimu amsini wa lukolu lwakuyi, yawalembitwi pamuhera. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Pahati Moabu, kaweriti Eliehoenai mwana gwa Zerahia, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu miya mbili. <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Zatu, kaweriti Shekania mwana gwa Yahazieli, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu miya tatu. <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Adini kaweriti Ebedi, mwana gwa Yonatani, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu amsini. <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu Eramu, kaweriti Yeshaya, mwana gwa Atalia, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu sabini. <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Shefatiya, kaweriti Zebadia mwana gwa Mikaeli, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu semanini. <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Yoabu, kaweriti Obadiya mwana gwa Yehieli, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu miya mbili kumi na nani. <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Bani, kaweriti, Shelomiti mwana gwa Yosifia, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu miya yimu na sitini. <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Bebayi kaweriti, Zekaria mwana gwa Bebai, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu ishilini na nani. <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Azigadi, kaweriti Yohanani mwana gwa Hakatani, kawuyiti pamuhera na wantu miya yimu na lilongu. <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Adonikamu, kaweriti Elifeleti, Yeueli na Shemaya, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu sitini, awa wawuyiti shakapanu. <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Mlonguziya gwa lukolu lwa Bigwayi, kaweriti Utayi na Zakuri, kawuyiti pamuhera na wapalu sabini.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra kankuwasakula Walawi toziya ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Niwajojonira wantu woseri mbwega ya lushemba lwalugenda mji gwa Ahava. Aku, tugolosiyiti ng'onjeru kwa mashaka matatu. Nuwakaguliti wantu woseri pamuhera na watambika, kumbiti nimwonitindiri hata Mlawi yumu. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Hangu niwashemiti wakulu tisa wizi kwa neni: Eliezeri na Arieli na Shemaya na Yaribu na Elinatani na Natani na Zekariya na Meshulamu, pamuhera na wafunda wawili, Yoyaribu na Elinatani. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />Nuwalagaliriti kwa Ido, mkulu gwa Wantu wa Kasifia, nimluwiti yomberi pamuhera na wayaguyi yawatenda lihengu Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu, watujegeri wantu yanawatendi lihengu Munumba Nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Kwa uheri lwakuyi Mlungu, watujegeriti Sherebia, muntu yakana luhala yakalawira mulukolu lwa Mahili, mwana gwa Lawi na mzukulu gwa Israeli, yomberi kiziti na wana wakuyi wapalu na wazukulu wakuyi kumi na nani. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Viravirii watujegeriti Hashabiya na Yeshaya, woseri wa lukolu lwa Merari, pamuhera na walongu wawu ishilini. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Vilaa, kuweriti na watendera wa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu miya mbili ishilini weni wambuyi wawu waweriti wasyagulitwi na mfalumi Dawudi na wakulu wakuyi kuwatanga Walawi. Matawu ga wantu woseri awa galembitwi.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezra kakuwalonguziya wantu koya kuliya na kuluwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Shakapanu, ndagaliriti kuwera wantu woseri tusoki pakwegera na lushemba Ahava su toyi kuliya na kulinanagaziya kulongolu kwa Mlungu gwetu na kumluwa katuloleri na kutulonguziya mumwanja gwetu pamuhera na wana wetu na lunda zyetu zoseri. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Meyiweri soni neni kumluwa mfalumi kampanani wamashonta na wakwenafarasi wa kutulolera na wankondu munjira toziya weriti niwagambira kala kuwera Mlungu gwetu kawatekelera woseri yawamsakula, kumbiti kawakalalira na kuwazibu woseri yawamleka. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Hangu twoyiti kuliya na kumluwa Mlungu katuloleri, na yomberi kankula galii gatumluwiti.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaviwu toziya ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Shakapanu nsyaguliti pakati pa wakulu wa watambika kumi na mbili, Sherebiya na Hashabiya pamuhera na wayaguyi kumi. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Awa niwapimiliti vipandi vya madini ga feza na zahabu na vyombu. Vintu avi vyeni mfalumi na watakula wakuyi na wakulu pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli vyawaweriti wavilaviya kwa tambiku ya Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu gwetu. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Avi ndo vintu vyaniwapimiliti: tani ishilini na mbil vya vipandi vya madini ga feza, Vyombu vyavinyawitwi kwa madini ga feza viweriti miya na utopa wakuyi kilu sabini na Zahabu kilu elufu tatu miya msheshi, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />Mabakuli ishilini gaganyawitwi kwa zahabu, utopa wakuyi kilu nani, Vyombu viwili vyavinyawitwi kwa shaba iherepa vyana beyi nkulu handa vya zahabu.<verse eid="EZR 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Shakapanu niwagambira, “Mwenga ndo wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu, vilaa na vyombu avi. Vipandi vya madini ga feza na zahabu vilaviwa kwa kufira weni kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wambuyi wetu vyeni ndo vilaa vya Mlungu.” <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Mviloleri na mvituli weri mpaka pamuvipima muvyumba vya numba ya Mtuwa Mlungu yayiwera aku Yerusalemu kulongolu kwa watambika na wakulu, Walawi na wakulu wa nkolu za Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Su, watambika na Walawi wankiti na kuvitula weri, vipandi vya madini ga feza na zahabu na vintu vyoseri vyawapimiti na kuvijegera Yerusalemu munumba ya Mlungu gwetu.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja gwa kuwuya Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Mulishaka lya kumi na mbili lya mwezi gwa kwanja, tulawiti mulushemba Ahava, kugenditi Yerusalamu. Mlungu gwetu kaweriti pamuhera na twenga, katulolera na wankondu na wapoka mnjira. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Patusokiti Yerusalemu, toyeriti kwa mashaka matatu. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Mlishaka lya msheshi, patuwera mngati mwa numba ya Mlungu gwetu, tupimiti vipandi vya madini ga feza ilii, zahabu na vyombu virii, shakapanu tumpanana mtambika Meremoti, mwana gwa Uria. Meremoti kaweriti pamuhera na Eleyazari, mwana gwa Finehasi kaweriti na Walawi wawili, Yozabali, mwana gwa Yeshuya na Nowadiya, mwana gwa Binuyi. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Kila shintu shiwalagitwi na kupimirwa na utopa wa kila shintu ulembitwi.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Shakapanu, wantu woseri yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu wamlaviliriti Mlungu gwa Israeli tambiku zawu za kulunguziwa. Walaviyiti wang'ombi shipalu kumi na mbili toziya ya Waisraeli woseri, wakondolu shipalu tisini na sita na mwanakondolu sabini na saba, viraa walaviyiti mbuzi kumi na mbili handa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. Vigongolu woseri awa walaviwitwi kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Viraavirii, wawapananiti watanga wa mfalumi na wakolamlima wa mji gwa kwaguzyetera mshenji mwa lushemba Eufrati, malagalira gawapananitwi na Mfalumi na womberi wawatangiti wantu na numba nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuyuga wadala yawawerandiri Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Pa mirandu yoseri ayi kutendeka, “Wakulu waniziliti na kung'ambira hangu, wantu wa Israeli, watambika na Walawi haweni lituli gweka na wantu wa isi zimonga weni wankutenda nkalaliru, handa walii Waamoni na Wamowabu na Wamisri na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waperizi na Wayebusi na Waamoni. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Wayahudi wankuwayuga wadala yawawerandiri wayahudi na viraavirii wawayugiziya wantemba wawu. Hangu wantu wa Mlungu walihanganika na wantu wa maisi gamonga. Walonguziya na wakulu wawu ndo yawanjiti kutenda makontola aga.” <verse eid="EZR 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Panigapikiniriti aga, mpapuliti nguwu zyangu na lihabiti lyangu, nizitupula viri zyangu na ndevu zyangu kwa hinginika nkulu na nilivagiti pasi agawu pawera na lyoga. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Shakapanu wantu woseri yawaweriti na lyoga toziya ya visoweru vyakalongiti Mlungu gwa Israeli kwa vidoda vya walii yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu pawanjiti kujojonika pakwegera na neni agawu pantira mpaka pamihi shaka sha kulaviya tambiku.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Pamihi, shaka sha kulaviya tambiku pashisokiti, ng'olokiti kwa hinginiku palii paweriti nilikala agawu nguwu zyangu na lihabiti paliwera lidegeka, nsuntamala na kunyasula mawoku gangu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwanga panduwa, <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />Gwee Mlungu gwangu, monasoni nkulu nentu kunyasula sheni shangu kulongolu kwaku. “Vidoda vyetu vilimamatira kupita mituwi yetu, kulii kuliwona kwetu twana makosa kusoka ata kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Kwanjira mashaka ga wambuyi wetu mpaka vinu, twenga tutenda vidoda nentu. Toziya ya vidoda vyetu twenga na vidoda vya wafalumi wetu na vidoda vya watambika wetu tukankwa na isi zimonga, tulaguwa, tutolwa lopola na kupokwa lunda zyetu. Na mpaka vinu, tulekerwa soni nentu. <verse eid="EZR 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />Kumbiti vinu, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu, kwa shaka shididini gutulanguziya lusungu lwaku na kuwatenda wamu wetu kulipota kulawa muuhamisiwu na kulikala kwa uponera pahala panu pananagala, pa muuhamisiwu gutupanana lusekeru na makaliru ga syayi. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Tembera twenga tuweriti wamanda kumbiti Mlungu gwetu gutulekandiri. Guwatenditi wafalumi wa Uajemi watutenderi maheri na kutuleka wakomu na kuyinyawa numba yaku yayibomukiti, na gwenga gututenda tulikali ponera panu Yuda na Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="EZR 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />“Kumbuti vinu, gwee Mlungu gwetu, tulongi shishi kwa goseri aga yagalawiliti? Pamuhera na goseri gagututenderiti, tuzijimirandiri lagiru zaku, <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />zyagutupanananiti kupitira wantumintumi waku wambuyi wa Mlungu, pagulonga, isi yamuyigendera na yeni hayiweri yenu ndo isi humba yana uhakata wa wanalushi kulawa isi gwekagweka, kwa makalaziwu gawu, wayimemiziya humba nduu kila pahala. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Hangu, namuwaleka wahinga wenu wayugwi na wana wawu, vilavilii namuwaleka wantemba wenu wawayugi na wahinga wawu. Viraa, namuwatanga walikali poneka pota nawawera na mbatiru, pamtenda hangu hamuweri na likakala na kulinoma mirandu miheri ya isi ayi na isi hayiweri ya wana wenu mashaka goseri. <verse eid="EZR 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />Goseri yagatupatiti gatupata toziya tutenditi makontola na madoda gavuwa. Kumbiti gwenga Mlungu gwetu, gututoza padidini kuliku vidoda vyetu vyatutenditi, na gwenga guwaleka wamu wetu wakomu. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Hashi, hatuzimegi lagiru zaku kayi na kuliyuga na wantu awa yawatenda makontola aga? Aga gakutenda gwenga gukalali Hashi, hapeni gutukalaliri na kutwagamiziya, nakasigala ata yumu gwetu mkomu pota yoseri gwa kuponeka? <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli, gwee gutenda ntambu yayifiruwa na gutuleka wakomu ntambu yatuwera leru. Tulonga vidoda vyetu kulongolu kwaku, patuvimana kuwera kwahera muntu yakaweza kwiza kulongolu kwaku pakawera yakana vidoda.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s">Kuyuga wadala wa isi zimonga kuberuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Ezra pakaweriti kankuluwa na kuleka vidoda agawu pakalira na kuligusiya makukama kulongolu kwa Numba Nkulu ya Mlungu, Waisraeli wavuwa, wapalu na wadala na wana, wajojonikiti pakwegera na yomberi pawalira kwa hinginika nentu. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Shakapanu Shekania, mwana gwa Yehieli gwa lukolu lwa Eramu, kamgambira Ezra, “Twahera waminika kwa Mlungu kwa kuyuga wadala washihenga, kumbiti ata hangu kwana litumbiru kwa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Hangu na tutendi lipatanu na Mlungu gwetu, tulekani na wadala awa pamuhera na wana wawu, kwa kufata galii yagulongiti na galii gawalongi wantu wamonga yawajimira lagiru za Mlungu. Goseri gatendekiti handa lagiru ntambu yalilongiti. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Gugoloki, gutendi mlandu agu, twenga twa pamuhera na gwenga. Hangu gulipanani moyu gutendi hangu,”<verse eid="EZR 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Ezra kanja kwa kuwalapiziya watambika na wakulu na Walawi na Waisraeli wamonga woseri handa hawatendi ntambu yawatakuliti, na womberi wajimira kulilapa. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Shakapanu, Ezra kawuka kulongolu kwa numba ya Mlungu, kagenda ukaya kwa Yehohanani, mwana gwa Eliashibu. Ezra kaweriti aku pashiru poseri pota kuliya pota kulanda mashi, toziya ya makontola ga wantu yawalawiti muuhamisiwu wawera waminikandiri.<verse eid="EZR 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Libweru lilaviwitwi kila pahala muisi ya Yuda na kumji gwa Yerusalemu kuwera wantu woseri yawalawiti muuhamisiwu wajojoniki Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Payiwera muntu yoseri hakasindi kusoka mushaka sha mashaka matatu handa wakulu ntambu yawalongiti, lunda zakuyi zoseri zipokwi, namweni hakaberuwi kuwera pamuhera na wantu yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwu. <verse eid="EZR 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Mumashaka aga matatu, wantu woseri yawalikaliti muisi ya Yuda na Benjamini wasokiti Yerusalemu na kujojonika muluwaga lwa numba ya Mlungu mulishaka lya ishilini lya mwezi gwa tisa. Wantu woseri weriti pawalendemera toziya ya mlandu gwawashemilitwi na mvula ivuwa yayiweriti payitowa.<verse eid="EZR 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Mtambika Ezra kagoloka kayowera na wantu, kawagambira, “Muweritindiri mwaminika kwa kuyuga wadala wa shihenga, hangu muyiyongelera ntambu yetu yakuliwona twana likosa mu isi ya Israeli.” <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Vinu, moyi vidoda vyenu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, “Mlungu gwa wambuyi wenu na kugatenda galii yagamfiriziya. Mlituli gweka na wanalushi wa isi ayi na kuwaleka wadala wenu wa shihenga.”<verse eid="EZR 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Wantu woseri wabota na kwankula kwa pamuhera, ndo teratera! “Twankutenda ntambu yagulongiti”. <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Kumbiti wongera kulonga, “Wantu awa ndo wavuwa na mvula yangutowa nentu. Tuwezandiri kwendeleya kugoloka panu paluwaga na toziya mlandu agu hagumalilikindiri kwa lishaka limu ama mawili! Toziya wavuwa wetu panu tutenda mlandu agu. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Mbaka wakulu wetu wasigala Yerusalemu kugutendera mlandu agu toziya ya wantu woseri. Shakapanu, kila yumu yakayugiti mdala kulawa isi imonga na kizi mulishaka lyalitulitwi na kizi na mdala gwakuyi na wakulu na watoza wa mji gwakuyi, mpaka maya ikalipa ya Mlungu gwetu payiwusiwa kwa twenga.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Kwahera muntu yakalemiti mlandu agu, ila Yonatani, mwana gwa Asaheri na Yazeya, mwana gwa Tikwa womberi walemiti mlandu agu, Meshulamu na Shabetayi gwa wiwuka wa Lawi, womberi waweriti pamuhera nawu.<verse eid="EZR 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Wantu woseri yawawuyiti kulawa muuhamisiwa wajimiliti mlandu agu, hangu mtambika Ezra kawasyaguliti wapalu pakati ya wakulu wa nkolu gwekagweka na kagalemba matawu gawu. Palisokiti lishaka lya tatu lya mwezi gwa kumi, wantu woseri wanjiti lihengu lya ulolalola wa mlandu agu, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />mulishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa kwanja, waweriti wamalira kala ulolalola wawu kwa wapalu woseri yawaweriti wayuga wadala wa shihenga.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wapalu yawayugiti wadala washihenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Ayi ndo walanga ya wapalu yawaweriti wayuga wadala washihenga: Watambika kulinganira na nkolu zawu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 10:18">Lukolu lwa Yoshuwa, mwana gwa Yehosadaki na walongu wakuyi waweriti; Maaseya na Eliezeri na Yaribu na Gedalia. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />Awa watakuliti hawawaleki wadala wawu na kila yumu hakalaviyi tambiku za kondolu shipalu kwa shidoda shakuyi.<verse eid="EZR 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Watambika wa Lukolu lwa Imeri kaweriti: Hanani na Zebadia.<verse eid="EZR 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Watambika wa Lukolu lwa Harimu kaweriti: Maaseya na Eliya na Shemaya na Yehieli na Uziya,<verse eid="EZR 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Watambika wa Lukolu lwa Pashuri waweriti: Eliehoenai na Maaseya na Ishimaeli na Netaneli na Yozabadi na Elasa. <verse eid="EZR 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Walawi yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 10:23">Yozabadi na Shimeyi na Kelaiya viraavirii wamshemiti Kelita, Petahiya na Yuda na Eliezeri <verse eid="EZR 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Wayimba yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 10:24">Eliashibu. Walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 10:24">Shalumu na Telemu na Uri. <verse eid="EZR 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Wantu wamonga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 10:25">kulawa lukolu lwa Paroshi yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Ramia na Izia na Malikiya na Miyamini na Eleazari na Malikiya na Benaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Lukolu lwa Eramu yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Mataniya na Zekaria na Yehieli na Abudi na Yeremoti na Eliya.<verse eid="EZR 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Lukolu wa Zatu yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Eliehoenai na Eliashibu na Matania na Yeremoti na Zabadi na Aziza.<verse eid="EZR 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Lukolu lwa Bebayi yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Yehohanani na Hananiya na Zabayi na Atilayi.<verse eid="EZR 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Ukolu lwa Bani yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Meshulamu na Maluki na Adaya na Yashubu na Sheyali na Yeremoti,<verse eid="EZR 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Lukolu lwa Pahati Moabu yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Adina na Kelali na Benaya na Maaseya na Mataniya na Besaleli na Binuyi na Manase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Lukolu lwa Harimu luweriti yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Eliezeri na Ishiya na Malikiya na Shemaya na Shimeoni, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />Benjamini na Maluki na Shemariya.<verse eid="EZR 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Lukolu lwa Hashumu yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Matenayi na Matata na Zabadi na Elifeleti na Yeremayi na Manasi na Shimeyi.<verse eid="EZR 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Lukolu lwa Bani yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Maadayi na Amramu na Ueli, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />Benaya na Bedeya na Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />Waniya na Meremoti na Eliashibu, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />Mataniya na Matenayi na Yaasu.<verse eid="EZR 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Lukolu lwa Binuyi yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti : Shimeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />Shelemia na Natani na Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />Makinadebayi na Shashayi na Sharayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />Azareyi na Shelemiya na Shemariya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />Shalumu na Amariya na Yosefu.<verse eid="EZR 10:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Lukolu lwa Nebo yawayugiti wadala wa shihenga waweriti: Yeieli na Matitiya na Zabadi na Zebina na Yadayi na Yoeli na Benaya,<verse eid="EZR 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Wapalu woseri awa wayugiti wadala wa shihenga. Su wawaleka wadala awa wawuki pamuhera na wana wawu.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>